<title>USA: Reliance Steel names CEO Crider as chairman.</title>
<headline>Reliance Steel names CEO Crider as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum Co said it named its chief executive, Joe Crider, to the additional position of chairman, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Crider, 67, replaces William Gimbel, who will remain on the company's board and serve as chairman emeritus.</p>
<p>Crider has been chief executive of Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum since 1994.</p>
<p>Gimbel, 78, has been chairman since 1964, the company said.</p>
</text>
